<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Perpetual half year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Perpetual half year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Dec 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 12.34 vs  9.51</p>
<p>    Net profit			 11.76 vs  6.29</p>
<p>    Sales				49.15 vs 42.31</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		    18 vs 14</p>
<p>NOTE: Perpetual Trustees Australia Ltd is trustee company and funds manager.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
